sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP TLS
    participant MLflowCtrl as MLflow Controller
    participant HelmRenderer as Helm Chart Renderer
    participant Discovery as Discovery API
    participant NSRBACCtrl as Namespace RBAC Controller
    participant AuthCR as Auth CR<br/>(platform.opendatahub.io)
    participant Workloads as Managed Workloads<br/>(Deployments, Services, PVCs)
    participant Metrics as Metrics Endpoint<br/>8443/TCP TLS

    Note over MLflowCtrl,Discovery: Startup Phase - Cluster Capability Discovery
    MLflowCtrl->>Discovery: Probe for Gateway API CRDs
    Discovery-->>MLflowCtrl: CRD present/absent
    MLflowCtrl->>Discovery: Probe for ConsoleLink CRDs
    Discovery-->>MLflowCtrl: CRD present/absent
    MLflowCtrl->>Discovery: Probe for ServiceMonitor CRDs
    Discovery-->>MLflowCtrl: CRD present/absent
    Note over MLflowCtrl: Register conditional watches<br/>based on discovered CRDs

    Note over User,Workloads: Control Plane Reconciliation
    User->>K8sAPI: Create MLflow CR<br/>(mlflow.opendatahub.io/v1)
    K8sAPI-->>MLflowCtrl: Watch event (label: app=mlflow)
    MLflowCtrl->>HelmRenderer: Render Helm chart templates
    HelmRenderer-->>MLflowCtrl: Kubernetes manifests
    MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Server-side apply<br/>(Deployment, Service, SA, PVC,<br/>CronJob, NetworkPolicy, Secret)
    K8sAPI-->>Workloads: Create/Update resources
    MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>(if Gateway API available)
    MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ConsoleLink<br/>(if OpenShift)
    MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceMonitor<br/>(if Prometheus available)
    MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update MLflow CR status

    Note over NSRBACCtrl,AuthCR: Workspace RBAC Propagation
    K8sAPI-->>NSRBACCtrl: Namespace labeled<br/>(opendatahub.io/mlflow-workspace)
    NSRBACCtrl->>K8sAPI: Get Auth CR
    K8sAPI-->>NSRBACCtrl: Auth configuration<br/>(user/group mappings)
    NSRBACCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create RoleBindings<br/>(mlflow-view, mlflow-edit)

    Note over Metrics: Observability
    Metrics->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>(validate bearer token)
    K8sAPI-->>Metrics: Token valid
    Metrics->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(check authorization)
    K8sAPI-->>Metrics: Authorized
    Note over Metrics: Serve /metrics (Prometheus)
